# Security notes are kept LOCAL ONLY and never pushed to the public repo.
# The conditional `security.md` deliverable lives at a module/submodule doc root
# (beside data.json). Ignore those, but keep legitimate agent solution docs that happen
# to be named security.md (they live under an agent/ directory, e.g. a module whose
# subject *is* security features).
**/security.md
!**/agent/**/security.md
.wave.txt
.wave-install.txt
.wave-retry.txt
*.swp
*.swo
*.sw[a-p]
*~
SECURITY-FINDINGS.md
